@startuml
title Multi-vendor Order Split
participant "Checkout" as Checkout
participant "OrderSplitSaga" as Saga
participant "Orders" as Orders
participant "Inventory" as Inventory
participant "Vendors" as Vendors
participant "RabbitMQ" as Broker

Checkout -> Saga: cart confirmed
Saga -> Inventory: reserve stock per vendor
Inventory --> Saga: reservations accepted
Saga -> Orders: create parent order
Orders -> Orders: group items by VendorId
Orders -> Orders: create VendorOrder per vendor
Orders --> Saga: parent order and vendor orders
Saga -> Vendors: notify vendors
Vendors --> Saga: acceptance pending
Saga -> Broker: publish OrderCreated
Broker --> Saga: event persisted
alt any reservation fails
  Saga -> Inventory: release reservations
  Saga -> Orders: cancel parent order
  Saga --> Checkout: checkout failed
else all reservations succeed
  Saga --> Checkout: order split complete
end
@enduml
